      "type": "object",
    },
    "name": "search_skills",
  },
  {
    "description": "Author a new skill (a Markdown playbook/reference other agents can load) (scoped to workspace "examples"). Provide either \`name\` (a slug) or \`title\` (a slug is derived from it), plus a one-line \`description\` and the Markdown \`body\`. Defaults to the directory layout (\`<name>/SKILL.md\`) so you can attach supporting files later with write_skill_file. Skills authored on the root endpoint are global; skills authored via a workspace are scoped to it by default — pass \`global\` to override.",
